                      (       ../ltoa.as):00001         *
                      (       ../ltoa.as):00002         * Compact standalone assembly implementation for the live cmoc_os9 ABI.
                      (       ../ltoa.as):00003         * Writes digits into the caller's buffer in reverse order, then calls
                      (       ../ltoa.as):00004         * reverse() once at the end, which keeps the stack footprint small.
                      (       ../ltoa.as):00005         *
                      (       ../ltoa.as):00006         
